# held/props/woodaxe: the woodcutter's axe for the Chop posture (PROPS, P2b): a bearded iron head with a lit edge on a pale
# ash haft; swung up over the head (raise) and down into the block (low). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. Around the pose arms'
# grips, anchored on the right shoulder; raised, it hangs behind the head.
